{"id":21452,"imdb":"tt0965649","en":"Case Closed: The Fourteenth Target","orig":"名探偵コナン 14番目の標的","ar":"المحقق كونان: الهدف الرابع عشر","tag":null,"ov":"تدور أحداث الفيلم حول الجرائم المتسلسلة، ويستخدم المجرم من أجلها أوراق اللعب بشكل تنازلي لاختيار ضحاياه بالترتيب، بحيث يحوي اسم الضحية على دلالة لورقة من أوراق اللعب. الضحية الأولى كانت المفتش جوزو ميغوري والذي يدل اسمه على الرقم 13 وهو الملك في ورق اللعب، حيث استطاع النجاة بعدما أصيب بواسطة سيف بشبه السيف الموجود بصورة الملك في ورق اللعب.","rd":"1998-04-18","rt":100,"g":[16,80,9648,12],"lang":"ja","budget":0,"revenue":16330622,"companies":[{"n":"TOHO","logo":"/fRSWWjquvzcHjACbtF53utZFIll.png","c":"JP"},{"n":"Kyokuichi-Tokyo Movie","logo":null,"c":"JP"},{"n":"Shogakukan","logo":"/isLUpud9N56ifftJZ4XvzwBBpoG.png","c":"JP"},{"n":"Shogakukan Production","logo":null,"c":"JP"},{"n":"Yomiuri Telecasting Corporation","logo":"/cIMyE9cw1W4kMFGxmC17HKTnVz9.png","c":"JP"},{"n":"Universal Music Japan","logo":"/ei16ncQFSAUVeq2w3Enrqq1xiRY.png","c":"JP"}],"countries":["JP"],"langs":["Japanese"],"col":"Detective Conan Collection","rel":[{"c":"JP","d":"1998-04-18"},{"c":"TW","d":"1998-07-07"},{"c":"IT","d":"2005-12-27"},{"c":"US","d":"2007-11-20"},{"c":"DE","d":"2015-07-01"},{"c":"VN","d":"2016-11-27"},{"c":"KR","d":"2025-02-14"}],"dir":["Kenji Kodama"],"prod":["Michihiko Suwa"],"wri":["Kazunari Kouchi"],"mus":["Katsuo Ono","Masayoshi Takanaka"],"dop":["Takashi Nomura"],"cast":[{"n":"Minami Takayama","ch":"Conan Edogawa (voice)","p":"/4Gunxt2UWnAX74ZoXKtqK2rI0e.jpg"},{"n":"Kappei Yamaguchi","ch":"Shinichi Kudo (voice)","p":"/mJyxKRZxLv9D7LH5KcNSkjSKYOB.jpg"},{"n":"Wakana Yamazaki","ch":"Ran Mouri (voice)","p":"/1hBk3w3v1p1VuAHs5On9nvL2rX2.jpg"},{"n":"Akira Kamiya","ch":"Kogoro Mouri (voice)","p":"/tJRMwbWFObv03KhATALs0Xbbgq7.jpg"},{"n":"Gara Takashima","ch":"Eri Kisaki (voice)","p":"/5L0kzTVITmOQdQ94NhicKM8ecCX.jpg"},{"n":"Chafurin","ch":"Inspector Megure (voice)","p":"/kiPG7EtYWxkj78US35gnTIMq5Dn.jpg"},{"n":"Kaneto Shiozawa","ch":"